# Variable names only; this reference does not configure an environment.
# A2 is Preview-only and defaults off. Production is always disabled.
# Text chat: DeepSeek official primary; AI Gateway fallback on retryable failure.
# One durable chat ledger caps total vendor chat spend at $25/month, failing closed.
# Voice remains off. Inquiry delivery defaults off, including in Preview.
CHAT_ENABLED
CHAT_VOICE_ENABLED
CHAT_BROWSER_VOICE_ENABLED
CHAT_INQUIRY_DELIVERY
CHAT_TRUSTED_ORIGINS
CHAT_IP_HASH_SALT
CHAT_DRAFT_TOOL_SECRET
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY
KV_REST_API_URL
KV_REST_API_TOKEN
VERCEL_ENV
VERCEL_URL
VERCEL_BRANCH_URL
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_SECRET
